{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a994bafa438a18e7","type":"text","text":"\"I had this dream, and I realized I wanted it to be true.\"\n\n\"What is it?\" Lilith asked. She knew that look: he had something not socially comfortable to say. \n\n\"It's... It's rather odd.\" He warned.\n\n\"Then you simply must tell me, please?\" She was rather curious. \n\n- [ ] she's often open to his thoughts that he thinks are less socially acceptable\n\n- [ ] \"I had this dream, that you were pregnant.\"\n\nHe whispered in her ear, \"There's a part of me that wishes... you were pregnant.\" \n\nShe supposed in a way it was a fitting irony. \"Your parents would never accept a child conceived out of wedlock.\" As they both knew it was the truth of the matter. \n\nHe sighed, \"I know. I suppose I find myself wanting children.\" Alex rested his hands on her belly.\n\nLilith would miss his touch when she broke things off before her womb was swollen from the child she carried. As his complete lack of affinity for vampiric darkness had not changed in the slightest. \"With anyone in particular, or is it a more general feeling?\"\n\n\"I'm not sure. There's this one, my parents introduced us not long ago. She's new money, but I think she might actually be interested in me. I'm not sure yet though.\" \n\n\"Well, only way to know is to give it time.\" She put her hands over his, repeating his own words back to him.\n\nHe looked down at her and smirked. \"How clever, a witty remark for sure.\" he repeated hers back at her, then leaned in to kiss her.\n\nShe let her tongue explore his mouth and they both moaned. This was indeed a temporary season, though it was rather fun. Maybe when her child was grown, she would date another human. If she found one charming enough.","x":-340,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"c6bcb9efb4c1baf7","type":"text","text":"That was something they had discussed before. Sometimes it was hard to tell rather a woman was interested in the Goth name or the Goth fortune. It was often some combination of the two when it was a woman he parents had introduced him to.\n\n\"Well, there's only one way I've found to find out.\"\n\n\"And that is?\"\n\n----\n\n\"She seems nice.\" He frowned. \n\nLilith raised an eyebrow, \"And?\"\n\n\"So many of them do, and generally all they are actually interested in is my family's name or my family's wealth.\" He said. \"No matter how much they act interested in me.\" \n\n\"How do you tell\" \n\n\"Well, only way to know is to give it time.\" Alex tisked. ","x":-880,"y":-340,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"61a0b70c95286fd8","type":"text","text":"Like if Alex is aware enough to realize he got this space to figure out what he wanted with his life, then would he wonder what Lilith got out of it. Obviously he doesn't know she got her daughter. \n\nHer smile was knowing, yet motherly, \"There is no need for you to concern yourself with that. I have gotten plenty from out time together.\"\n","x":260,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"de42ec3259e66ddb","type":"text","text":"Idk. If he does offer her any money, she won't take it. \n\n\"Are you sure? It's not enough for anyone in my family to notice.\"\n\n\"I appreciate that you want to ensure I have the resources I need, but I assure you, I have no need for your family's money. I have enough of my own for my needs and desires.\" \n\nI mean idk if I want to include that, but like I said, even if he does offer, she won't take it. She honestly doesn't need it. And not because her family is old money the way his is, she's old enough that she's earned enough that she just has money. ","x":260,"y":-700,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"cc630eabecc1bc17","type":"text","text":"Also, I agree: it takes a bit of time, but he comes to trust Lilith in a way he hasn't been able to trust other people in his life. She can tell this is the sort of person he is, she's seen it before. She knows he's going to come to trust her, and then come to find what he actually wants, and that it won't be vampirism. Again not because of vampire senses, just because she's seen a lot of patterns in all her years. She doesn't have any need to judge him or expect anything of him. She doesn't care about a human family or money really. She has her own place in vampire society. And it's refreshing for him to spend time with someone that simply just wants his company. She knows high chance he'll want a bride when he relaxes, so at some point after Emma is back from the dead and has been for a time, Lilith lets herself get pregnant. She essentially choose to have him be the bio father of her child before he reaches that conclusion. Because she can see the writing on the wall, she knows whre he's headed mentally.\n\nNow I'm wondering if he ever stops to wonder what she gets out of this. Like if Alex is aware enough to realize he got this space to figure out what he wanted with his life, then would he wonder what Lilith got out of it. Obviously he doesn't know she got her daughter.\n\nHer smile was knowing, yet motherly, \"There is no need for you to concern yourself with that. I have gotten plenty from out time together.\"\n\n----\n\nor something like that? Idk. If he does offer her any money, she won't take it.\n\n\"Are you sure? It's not enough for anyone in my family to notice.\"\n\n\"I appreciate that you want to ensure I have the resources I need, but I assure you, I have no need for your family's money. I have enough of my own for my needs and desires.\"\n\n----\n\nAnyway, like I said the story could just not spell out what Alex thinks. Also I might have it be that he had a dream that she was, one of those things were some part of the subconscious knows what the mind doesn't? Maybe, I'm not sure. Idk, it's an idea but ideas still need to be thought through at least to some degree.\n\n\"Dressing down for once?\" Alex asked.\n\nLilith shrugged, \"Call it a frumpy day.\" Her pants no long fit, and she hadn't been sure if her normal shirt had been baggy enough. Even though vampire pregnancies progressed slowly, they still progressed. \"How did it go with Jayceon?\"\n\nHe blushed a little, \"Good, it went really good actually. She's just as tired of her parents' expectations as I am with mine. I know mine mean well, but I think we actually connected.\"\n\nIdk, I guess I want to leave it on a note that Lilith isn't sure if he knows. Maybe he says or does something, and she honestly isn't sure. Because I think I like the idea that he himself isn't sure, but if Lilith if isn't going to clearly offer the info willingly, he's not going to push the issue. Maybe a moment of that look when he has a thought that isn't so social acceptable, then brushes it off. I guess I don't want him to be dumb or clueless. Until he gets serious with this other women, he and Lilith are still physically imamate. Even once she knows she's pregnant. And they have been for a few years at that point. Like I said, maybe he's unsure, and maybe he's ok with that. Sure plenty of guys would lose their minds over something like that, but well he's not a creep. Not that he doesn't care about a potential child, but like I said Alex figures that if she is and if she wanted to know, she would tell him. They're close enough for that and he's open to it. And she was upfront that this would be temporary and she wasn't getting married or building a life regardless. He might check if she's sure, but she says she's sure. He might make sure to say something about \"hey, if you ever need something, don't hesitate to ask. Yes I'm getting married, but if you ever need something, don't let that stop you from calling. It doesn't mean I can't help you.\" and again Lilith is like I appreciate that, but I will be fine. I guess I like them having this close shifting dynamic as Alex gets serious with the other woman. It's kinda unique at least in my story world. Because for Lilith, if anything she's let this go on longer than she meant to. She's totally secure about Alex falling for someone. In some ways he's a little like a fledging to her. I mean no like a child, but she's helping him grow into being himself I guess. Anyway, let's go deep and think on rather this fit the characters and how this might affect everyone else and all that detailed stuff please.","x":-620,"y":301,"width":400,"height":400}
	],
	"edges":[]
}